    - rid: 1123138610053513218
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: The Lantern Keeper
        text: They sheltered here. I know where they went. Spirits trade knowledge through bargains. Win our game, and my answer is yours.
        continueLabel: Ask about the charms
        duration: 5
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513219
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: What a bargain reveals
        text: Accept to discover Open Gate, Still Reflection, and Rising Sun. Discovery reveals a family's charms; owning a charm lets it appear in future offers.
        continueLabel: Hear the gift
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513220
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A gift for the road
        text: Take {charm}. May it open the way when your next bargain begins.
        continueLabel: Hear the terms
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
