        victoryTitle: A promise kept
        victoryText: You have earned an answer. They crossed the marsh before dawn, toward the old watchtower. Climb the steps. The watcher may have seen more.
        defeatTitle: The lantern is still burning
        defeatText: Not tonight. The road will wait, and so will I. Come back when you are ready to try again.
